  "name": "Aubergine Tomato Satay Curry",
  "subtitle": "Creamy peanut curry with crisp onion topping",
  "description": "A rich, gently spiced aubergine and tomato curry finished with lime, coriander, and crispy onions. Serve with steamed basmati rice.",
